Address vpn.egort.name

Log notice syslog

DataDirectory {{ volume_dir }}/tor

ExitRelay 0

SocksPort {{ wg_addr4 | regex_replace('/\d+$', '') }}:{{ tor_socks_port }}

SocksPolicy accept {{ wg_addr4 }}
SocksPolicy reject *

ControlPort 0
DirPort {{ tor_dir_port }}
ORPort {{ tor_or_port }} IPv4Only

Nickname justiceforall

AccountingStart day 0:00
AccountingMax 150 GBytes
AccountingRule out

RelayBandwidthRate 2 MBytes
RelayBandwidthBurst 4 MBytes
